# 统一换行符：文本文件按 LF 入库，避免跨平台换行噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.db binary
